      'faq.1': 'Frequently asked questions',
      'faq.2': 'My cast is damaged. Can you still make something of it?',
      'faq.3': 'In many cases, yes. Cracks, chipped edges or discolouration can often be repaired or cleverly worked into the design. Just send us photos – then we can first assess what’s possible.',
      'faq.4': 'Does my cast have to be completely finished?',
      'faq.5': 'No. It’s enough if the plaster cast itself exists and has fully dried. We’re happy to take care of smoothing, priming and everything else. If your cast isn’t finished yet, just get in touch – we’ll advise you.',
      'faq.6': 'Can I send you my own flowers or decorations?',
      'faq.7': 'Absolutely. Whether flowers from your wedding bouquet, a dummy or a little bracelet – personal pieces make your keepsake even more special. For fresh flowers, we’ll clarify in advance how they can be preserved.',
      'faq.8': 'Can you include a name or a date of birth?',
      'faq.9': 'Yes. Names, dates of birth, time, weight or personal lettering can be worked in subtly or as an eye-catcher – in gold or tone on tone.',
      'faq.10': 'How long does it take?',
      'faq.11': 'The time depends on effort, materials and workload, and is discussed with you before you place the order.',
      'faq.12': 'Can my cast be shipped?',
      'faq.13': 'Yes, throughout Germany. We check shipping individually, help you pack safely and always tell you the costs in advance.',
      'faq.14': 'What if my cast is very large?',
      'faq.15': 'Even large casts of around 140 × 120 cm are possible. In that case we can arrange suitable shipping or a freight carrier on request, or agree on a collection in the region.',
      'faq.16': 'Can I just send you some photos first?',
      'faq.17': 'Of course. You can upload photos of your cast in the enquiry form – with no obligation.',
      'faq.18': 'Do I have to pay anything right away?',
      'faq.19': 'No. After your request you first receive an individual quote. Work only begins once everything feels right for you.',
      'final.1': 'Some memories deserve a special place.', 'final.2': 'Perhaps your baby bump cast has been waiting far too long already.',
